{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x30e43a",
      "back_en": "Vurai is coming.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e486",
      "back_en": "He's... still alive?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Ordem um pouco invertida, mas correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e654",
      "back_en": "to do is to take him down again.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento; 'derrubá-lo' aceitável p/ trounce."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e6e9",
      "back_en": "only I have a chance against his power.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e741",
      "back_en": "wiped out an entire army on his own...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e7c5",
      "back_en": "No. It's the opposite.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e8df",
      "back_en": "at full power?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e91f",
      "back_en": "caught up to our carriage. He's not done yet.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30ef65",
      "back_en": "don't linger too long.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f021",
      "back_en": "Aaand up you go--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f033",
      "back_en": "Ah!? Wh-What are you doing!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Perde 'do you think', mas ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f08d",
      "back_en": "that promise, Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f0a3",
      "back_en": "L-Let go of me! Release me! Where are you touching!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f185",
      "back_en": "Let go of me! Please, dear brother--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f298",
      "back_en": "Vurai.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f3d7",
      "back_en": "and send them off with honor. You understand.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'valor' virou 'honra'; preferir 'bravura/valor'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f443",
      "back_en": "disappointed that we didn't wake her up.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f54c",
      "back_en": "left Oshtor behind.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f5e6",
      "back_en": "thinking. \"Don't touch me. Don't talk to me.\"",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f8b5",
      "back_en": "What a joke!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido de descrença mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f8c3",
      "back_en": "That stubborn girl--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'kid'→'menina'; ok no contexto (Nekone)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f8d7",
      "back_en": "Let them tell me she's not going back to Oshtor!?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Inverteu o sentido; 'Don't tell me she's going back' = 'Não me diga que ela vai voltar'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f962",
      "back_en": "NEKONE! Rulutieh, stop the carriage!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f9a6",
      "back_en": "I'll go get her. You all stay--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fa0b",
      "back_en": "Wait. I'll handle this.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fa84",
      "back_en": "If that's the case, I'll go with you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fccc",
      "back_en": "Hm. You really do trust him so much...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fea5",
      "back_en": "I know... I know I can't be of much help...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310131",
      "back_en": "You... wouldn't even allow me that...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3103ea",
      "back_en": "a minute after you promised!? You can only watch.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310423",
      "back_en": "Just don't get in Oshtor's way. He's coming.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31045a",
      "back_en": "YOU DARED OFFER ME MERCY.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'show'→'oferecer'; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310473",
      "back_en": "YOU WOULD HAVE KNOWN EASILY.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310492",
      "back_en": "YOU COULD SEE THAT I STILL DREW BREATH.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3104ba",
      "back_en": "YET YOU CHOSE TO ABANDON ME, WITHOUT",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3104df",
      "back_en": "DELIVERING THE FINAL BLOW...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3104fe",
      "back_en": "I SEE [grammar error]. SO IT IS TRUE...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'EU VER' agramatical; usar 'ENTENDO'/'JÁ VEJO'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310516",
      "back_en": "YOU SULLY MY HONOR AS A MONONOFU,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31053a",
      "back_en": "AND TO FORCE IMMORTAL SHAME UPON ME.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'FORÇAR' (infinitivo) quebra a conjugação; deveria ser 'FORÇA'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31055c",
      "back_en": "UNFORGIVABLE...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31056e",
      "back_en": "THAT IS UNFORGIVABLE!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310584",
      "back_en": "YOU SHALL PAY FOR THIS MOCKERY",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3105a5",
      "back_en": "WITH YOUR HEAD!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3105df",
      "back_en": "life?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3105e5",
      "back_en": "THIS STRENGTH WAS GRANTED BY THE MIKADO.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310610",
      "back_en": "DEFEAT IS NOT AN OPTION. MY POWER CANNOT",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31063b",
      "back_en": "NOT BE TAINTED SO!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Dupla negação; com 'NÃO PODE' anterior basta 'SER MACULADO ASSIM'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3107c9",
      "back_en": "Akuruka, open thy gates and guide my path to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3107f8",
      "back_en": "the primal origin!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31082d",
      "back_en": "SHALL RETURN... NO MATTER WHAT!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310864",
      "back_en": "HAAAAHHH!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31087b",
      "back_en": "Dear brother!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Ok (alterna caro/querido irmão)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31088a",
      "back_en": "Urgh... Hold on...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310985",
      "back_en": "what it would really be like...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310a07",
      "back_en": "was far more than he could take...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310a58",
      "back_en": "just to buy us time...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'nos ganhar tempo' um pouco torto, mas ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310b0d",
      "back_en": "He just needs one blow to end this...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310b60",
      "back_en": "Your wounds are holding you back?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Omite 'BELIEVE', mas fragmento; sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310c04",
      "back_en": "HAAAAHHH!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310c42",
      "back_en": "POWER!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento reordenado; provável objeto da frase."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310c48",
      "back_en": "AKURUKA, I NEED MORE! FEAST THOU UPON MY",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310c76",
      "back_en": "SOUL, AND SHOW ME POWER THAT SURPASSES ALL!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'surpassa' válido em PT literário."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310cb2",
      "back_en": "FALL, VURAI!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310cf0",
      "back_en": "BUT NOT WELL ENOUGH!!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'NÃO BEM O BASTANTE' torto; usar 'NÃO BOM O BASTANTE/NÃO O SUFICIENTE'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310d06",
      "back_en": "YOU ARE WEAK! WEAK!...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310d83",
      "back_en": "THY POWER!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310d8f",
      "back_en": "wall_normal",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source é identificador 'wall_normal' mas target é frase ('um mundo novo te espera'); descompasso, verificar."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310d9c",
      "back_en": "wall_crack",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Identificador mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310ddd",
      "back_en": "THIS IS THE END...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310e18",
      "back_en": "MY EQUAL...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310e90",
      "back_en": "DUST FROM WHENCE YOU CAME... OSHTOR!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310ec3",
      "back_en": "Ah... hh...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310ed0",
      "back_en": "Nekone... what... have you...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310f0e",
      "back_en": "if it had hit...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310f26",
      "back_en": "YOU... DARE...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310f41",
      "back_en": "YOU DARE...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310f4d",
      "back_en": "Nekone, RUN!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310f5b",
      "back_en": "Ah... a-ah... nnh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310f70",
      "back_en": "YOU DARE VIOLATE THIS DUEL BETWEEN MEN.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310fae",
      "back_en": "RRRAAAGH!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310fdc",
      "back_en": "I am so... sorry...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3110f6",
      "back_en": "GATES... THE GATES TO THE ORIGIN...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311148",
      "back_en": "OF YOUR POWER!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311290",
      "back_en": "NO... OSHTOR... YOU HAVE--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Corte literal aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31152c",
      "back_en": "that I am only doing it for my dear brother...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31155b",
      "back_en": "Dear brother!! A-Ah--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3115c6",
      "back_en": "O-Oshtor...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3115f2",
      "back_en": "Do you remember... the day we first met...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3116c1",
      "back_en": "A cliff, back to back...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Reordenado, sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31176e",
      "back_en": "...Wait... He's not... bleeding?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3117c0",
      "back_en": "healing, like... like before.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311809",
      "back_en": "disappearing from him...?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'falling off' = 'caindo/desprendendo dele', não 'desaparecendo'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311820",
      "back_en": "D-Dear... brother?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311833",
      "back_en": "Oshtor... your leg...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311849",
      "back_en": "Why is... your leg... fading away...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'his'→'sua' ambíguo, mas ok no contexto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x31186e",
      "back_en": "You are... such a bizarre man...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311920",
      "back_en": "to figure out a solution...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311a43",
      "back_en": "day by day, into a truly skilled leader...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Acrescenta 'verdadeiramente'; menor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311a8b",
      "back_en": "I truly did have fun...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'tive diversão' meio torto, mas sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311aa3",
      "back_en": "Yes... truly joyful, indeed...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'such fun'→'deveras alegre' desloca para 'alegre'; preferir 'tanta diversão'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311abe",
      "back_en": "So that means... He's already...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311adf",
      "back_en": "No... It cannot be... Dear brother, please...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311b1e",
      "back_en": "Heh. Please, do not cry... Nekone.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311b41",
      "back_en": "This is the fate that awaits us Akuruturuka...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311b85",
      "back_en": "No... no...!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311b93",
      "back_en": "Oshtor, you're--",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'você é--' implica identidade; aqui provável 'você está--' (morrendo/sumindo)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311ba4",
      "back_en": "...I leave Her Highness... in your hands.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311bce",
      "back_en": "...I'm counting on you, kid.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311beb",
      "back_en": "Nekone, live on... and find happiness.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311c14",
      "back_en": "And keep the kid... out of trouble... for me...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311c44",
      "back_en": "AAAAHHH!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311c7d",
      "back_en": "Dear brother!! Dear brother, please...!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311ca8",
      "back_en": "AAAAHHH!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311cd1",
      "back_en": "env_DownArm_3_R",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Identificador de asset; target é placeholder '[LINE NOT IN SOURCE LIST]'; verificar escopo."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x311ce1",
      "back_en": "env_jaw",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Identificador de asset; target é placeholder; verificar escopo."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e29f",
      "back_en": "All I see is the gorge growing more and more",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e47f",
      "back_en": "cheek.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30e511",
      "back_en": "I shall hold him off here. I wish for all of you",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30ea46",
      "back_en": "Don't worry about it. Can't really argue the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30eb7a",
      "back_en": "to simply watch over you. So please--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'watch over'→'cuidar de'; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30ec28",
      "back_en": "Yet you--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30ed3e",
      "back_en": "But...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30f677",
      "back_en": "idea.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fa7b",
      "back_en": "That's--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fc40",
      "back_en": "You sure about this, Kuon?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fe1b",
      "back_en": "side--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fe22",
      "back_en": "I have to help him!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30fe73",
      "back_en": "That's not--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x310391",
      "back_en": "out there!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
